<title>UK: BOE gives UK money market no help.</title>
<headline>BOE gives UK money market no help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it did not operate in the UK money market. It revised its forecast shortage to 150 million stg.</p>
</text>
